# Only what the application image needs: the Rust workspace (the tiers, the entry points and the suite, because the
# workspace manifest names them all as members), the UI build script, the site's static files, the form templates.
# The wasm is built inside the image, so any local build of it is left out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!web
!middle
!db
!cli
!forge
!tests
target
!scripts/rust-ui-build.sh
!public
public/rust-ui
!middle/model/forms/templates
